1082
00:38:16,252 --> 00:38:18,296
- It's the final question.
- Advice?

1083
00:38:18,630 --> 00:38:21,216
I'd just like to say that you've got this.

1084
00:38:21,466 --> 00:38:22,467
I've got this.

1085
00:38:22,550 --> 00:38:23,927
I say that for a reason.

1086
00:38:24,219 --> 00:38:27,263
As a 20-year-old,
you've got your whole life ahead of you.

1087
00:38:27,347 --> 00:38:29,766
I hope you navigate the journey wisely.

1088
00:38:29,849 --> 00:38:31,226
- I've got this.
- Good luck.

1089
00:38:31,309 --> 00:38:33,436
- Stay strong, too.
- Thank you.

1090
00:38:34,145 --> 00:38:36,397
Did I take it too seriously?

1091
00:38:36,439 --> 00:38:39,234
- Not at all, it was nice.
- I mean it, though.

1092
00:38:39,275 --> 00:38:41,277
- Thank you.
- I'll be cheering you on.

1093
00:38:41,694 --> 00:38:45,406
"STAY STRONG THROUGHOUT YOUR JOURNEY"

1094
